    <briefdescription>
<para>REST controller for service-directory entities (clinics, pharmacies, laboratories, centers). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A {serviceType} path segment selects a <ref refid="classServiceController" kindref="compound">ServiceController&lt;T&gt;</ref> from a variant registry. Handlers use the shared callback pattern to map controller status codes to JSON HTTP responses, build a <ref refid="structRequester" kindref="compound">Requester</ref> from Auth attributes, and run async coroutines or the DbExecutor-backed dispatch according to DatabaseConfig::async. All routes are SECURE. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
